   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A transgender client comes to the clinic to start initial FTM-transition hormone therapy with testosterone. Which laboratory test does the nurse recognize as being the most important one to do before starting therapy?",
